+  their missing held poses; a rage without a clip falls back to the cast. Test `clipsCoverReleasesAndElites` (every
+  elite-capable kind of the Understage shows every elite ability and holds its three poses); strips
+  `strips/cable_gnawer_*`, `strips/heckler_*`, `sw/`.
+- **F11 halves die the split death** (breaks, rough): fixed (eceeac9, dd60cd5, 2c2b41d) together with F1; a split half dies its own small death
+  (`death.half`, sent as `Motion.DEATH`), nothing comes out of it. Test `dustBunnySplitsAtItsPop` (second half),
+  animcheck `a split half dies its own death`.
+- **F12 the Rat King's crumbs hang** (breaks, rough): fixed (eceeac9): the crumbs are falling dust (gravity, then a slow drift
+  down), of a bread and a biscuit colour; the Eternal Understudy's confetti had the same cause and falls now too.
+  Picture `fight/fight1b_rat_king_death_*` (camera tilted up).
